---
Rank recorded directories and print the best match, falling back to a disk walk (SPEC section 11) when nothing matches

Usage: furet query [OPTIONS] <QUERY>

Arguments:
  <QUERY>  Query text; quote it when it contains spaces

Options:
      --list       Print every ranked candidate, best first; an empty query lists by recency instead
      --explain    Print the scoring report on stderr and jump nowhere
      --color      Wrap every `--list` path in its `LS_COLORS` directory color
      --no-ignore  Disable gitignore rules in the disk fallback walk (SPEC section 11)
  -h, --help       Print help
